{"t": 1794108437.5659332, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix in `checkout.promo.normalize_code`.\n\n**Root cause (Sentry CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q):** `PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist` \u2014 the Android keyboard adds surrounding spaces and lower-cases input, and codes were looked up without normalisation (2,940 events, os=Android 15, app=android 8.2).\n\n**Change:** `normalize_code` now strips surrounding whitespace, removes inner whitespace, and upper-cases the code before lookup:\n\n```python\ndef normalize_code(code: str) -> str:\n    return \"\".join(code.split()).upper()\n```\n\nVerified locally: `' autumn24 '`, `'Autumn 24'` and `'AUTUMN24'` all normalise to `AUTUMN24`; tabs/newlines are removed too.", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
{"t": 1794108438.733914, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_get_issue", "args": {"include": "comments", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
